PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categorias/desarrollo
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "obras_asociadas": 2
}

### Editar un categoria que no existe -> 404
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categorias/999
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "obras_asociadas": 2
}

